CM Inverted V for 80 m over average ground (Sommerfeld-Norton),
CM with average gain check.
CE
SY hgh=20, len=20, ang=110
SY Z=len*cos(ang/2), X=len*sin(ang/2)
GW 1 20 -X 0 hgh-Z -0.1 0 hgh #12
GW 2 1 -0.1 0 hgh 0.1 0 hgh #12
GW 3 20 0.1 0 hgh X 0 hgh-Z #12
GE 1
GN 2 0 0 0 14 0.006
EX 0 2 1 0 1 0
FR 0 2 0 0 3.6 0.1
RP 0 10 13 1001 0 0 10 30
EN
